{"sections":[{"slug":"Weyl群","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Weyl群"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Weyl 群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">极大环面的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极大环面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大环面</span>"}},{"Plain":" $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正规化子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正规化子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $N(H)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的商群</span>\n$$\r\nW = N(H)/H.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个重要的观察是</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群共轭作用在极大环面</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且这个作用有效</span> (effective), <span lang=\"zh\">即单位元素外每个元素的作用非平凡</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一般子群的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对任意的子群</span> $H\\subset G$ <span lang=\"zh\">也可以定义</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $W_GH := N(H)/H$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> Weyl group <span lang=\"zh\">是能够典范地作用于一个</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用的</span> $H$-<span lang=\"zh\">不动点的最大群</span>. Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群也是陪集空间</span> $G/H$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的轨道范畴中的自同构群</span>.</p>\n<h3>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $W\\subset GL(\\mathfrak h^*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $\\{s_\\alpha: \\alpha\\in\\Phi\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $s_\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是关于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">的正交补空间的反射</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathrm {U}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的极大环面是</span> $T=\\{\\operatorname{diag}(e^{i\\theta_1},\\cdots,e^{i\\theta_n})\\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群通过置换特征值作用在</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群为置换群</span> $S_n$.</p>\n<p>$\\mathrm {SU}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群亦为置换群</span> $S_n$.</p>\n<p>$\\mathrm {SO}(2n+1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群为</span> $(\\mathbb{Z}/2)^n \\rtimes S_n$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}